## Staging DNS

After the first staging deploy, point the staging domain at the new CloudFront distribution:

```sh
pnpx @soliantconsulting/sld-dns-control-client point-staging-domain
```

This reads `.sld-dns-control.json`, finds the deployed stack's `DistributionDomainName` output,
and upserts the CNAME via the DNS control API. Only needed once after the initial deploy;
subsequent deploys keep the same CloudFront domain.
{%- endif %}
